  "description": "Reid Blacktop 2.0 SO | Commuter eBike\nPractical commuter features. Comfortable everyday riding.\nThe Reid Blacktop 2.0 SO is an electric commuter bike designed to make everyday journeys simpler. With an Ananda mid-drive motor and 9-speed gearing, it combines electric assistance with versatile gearing for commuting and urban riding\nThe Ananda mid-drive motor delivers a natural pedalling feel, helping riders manage daily journeys and varied urban routes. The 9-speed Shimano gearing provides a range of options for different riding conditions, while the Ananda LCD display keeps key ride information visible\nEquipped with hydraulic disc brakes and 2.1-inch semi-slick tyres, the Blacktop 2.0 SO offers controlled braking and grip for everyday road use in a range of weather conditions\nPractical accessories come fitted as standard, including mudguards, a rear rack and a heavy-duty rear stand. Ergonomic grips add comfort for regular rides, making the Blacktop 2.0 SO a ready-equipped option for commuters looking for an alternative to car journeys\nThe Reid Blacktop 2.0 SO is ideal for:\n\nDaily commuting – Electric assistance for regular journeys to work and around town\n\nVersatile riding – 9-speed Shimano gearing for a range of urban routes\n\nComfortable journeys – Ergonomic grips for a more comfortable hold\n\nReliable braking – Hydraulic disc brakes for controlled stopping\n\nEveryday practicality – Mudguards and a rear rack fitted as standard\n\nConvenient parking – Heavy-duty rear stand for everyday use\n\nUrban road riding – 2.1-inch semi-slick tyres for grip and stability\n\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
